{"synopsis":"Jiang Wang dikhianati oleh saudara angkatnya sendiri, Fang Pengju, yang mencuri hadiah pil Pembukaan Meridian dari Akademi Dao di Soulscans—pil yang telah ia peroleh dengan darah dan kerja kerasnya. Di ambang kematian, Jiang Wang mewarisi peninggalan Zuo Guanglie, seorang jenius dari Dinasti Chu, lalu berhasil membuka meridiannya dan memulai jalan kultivasi. Meski awalnya bingung dan ragu, ia selalu berpegang pada cahaya di dalam hatinya—sebuah hati yang murni dan setia pada niat awalnya.","alternative_title":"赤心巡天～最強剣士への覚醒～","author":"Yuewen Manhua","artist":"Yuewen Manhua","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"aee03551-7ae7-419f-a530-6655191e4730","number":"62","chapter":"62","title":"","date":"2026-07-29","released":"2026-07-29"},{"chapter_id":"c9da2b08-b59a-49e2-bb77-3392d6636663","number":"61","chapter":"61","title":"","date":"2026-07-29","released":"2026-07-29"},{"chapter_id":"bb93593b-30dd-4daf-b5e0-1abaa83da5a5","number":"60","chapter":"60","title":"","date":"2026-07-19","released":"2026-07-19"},{"chapter_id":"8f19478a-398d-44fe-a7a5-836473402691","number":"59","chapter":"59","title":"","date":"2026-07-19","released":"2026-07-19"},{"chapter_id":"274af0a5-5ab1-4886-aed5-fa870c2a0ba2","number":"58","chapter":"58","title":"","date":"2026-07-08","released":"2026-07-08"},{"chapter_id":"147feff8-63ca-473a-a9e4-a426af9d1cff","number":"57","chapter":"57","title":"","date":"2026-07-03","released":"2026-07-03"},{"chapter_id":"5257140e-9ba6-4e55-9192-5e72a341d026","number":"56","chapter":"56","title":"","date":"2026-06-26","released":"2026-06-26"},{"chapter_id":"2caba6be-d3b4-422b-91bf-d6edf7722f8b","number":"55","chapter":"55","title":"","date":"2026-06-26","released":"2026-06-26"},{"chapter_id":"f53f78f1-4bcc-4cd9-ab7e-f5c10d441cb4","number":"54","chapter":"54","title":"","date":"2026-06-18","released":"2026-06-18"},{"chapter_id":"9c792ade-9516-44fa-a42a-335be0cf46ee","number":"53","chapter":"53","title":"","date":"2026-06-18","released":"2026-06-18"},{"chapter_id"